<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimone</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jha Pauli kwa Filemone</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimone</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Filimone</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chenje kijhipe cha Filimone kikajhandikwe na ntenga Pauli, mu chula jha 1:1. Pauli pakibha mukipungo ku Loma pajhandika kitabo, yenio pange iwechekana ajhandika pakibha ku Loma na anda akibha ku Loma bhahe, iwechekana kikajhandikwe muchaka cha makome chita na limo kubhoke pabhelwika Yecho Kilichitu, ndi chaka cheche pange iwechekana pajhandika kitabo cha Akakolochahe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli anyandikila baluwa jhenje mundo jhumo liina lyake Filimone. Filimone akibha jhumo pakate jha lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu na helahela akibha na akabhanda bhake. Pauli anyandikila kupala kunnyopa akotoka kunapula mmanda gwake jwakemitwa Onechimo jwanywogholwike kubhoke kwa Filimone. Kwa malaghilo gha Kiloma Filimone apalitwa ankome Onechimo. Pauli ngampembelekiya Filimone na kunneke mwojho annyeketele Onechimo ngita nnongo mu kulombona na Kilichitu, helahela annyopa annekekeye Onechimo ahenge lihengo pamo na Pauli, mu chula jha 1:13-14.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli innyambucha Filimone, mu chula jha 1:1-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele Pauli innyopa Filimone ampokele Onechimo ngita nnongo mu Kilichitu, mu chula jha 1:4-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ijhomolela kwa kutangacha mawacho ghake gha kwatyangila na kwajhambucha, mu chula jha 1:22-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Ne Napauli, napungwa ku nhwalo gwa kunhenge Kilichitu Yecho. Mmii pamba pamonga na nnongo gwito Timocheyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Tunnyandikii mwe makoche bhito ma Filimone, nhenga lihengo nnyito, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na lilongo lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu lilikongina kajhino na mwenga nnombo gwito Afiya na kwa nkomana ngondo nnyito Alukipo.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ninyope umbone nu uteeke kuhumii kwa Chapanga Tate gwito na Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalo na kihobholelo cha Filimone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Machiko ghoha puninnyopa Chapanga ninkomboka mwe ma Filimone nu kunchenguu Chapanga gwango, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />nhwalo nnyohine chimuhobholela Bhambo Yecho na chimapala bhando bha Chapanga bhoha. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ninnyope kwa Chapanga kupala kihobholelo chino chenie chimihenga pamonga na twenga kwa Chapanga, kijhingii nkate hake na nhoto kubhehe na uhotolo gwa kumanya hake na mota yoha itupata kwa kulombana na Kilichitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Nnongo gwango, lipalano lino linhalalii hake na linneki mwojho! Mwenga mihanganiche miojho jha bhando bhoha bha Chapanga.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli annyopa Filimone ampoke Onechimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ku nhwalo gwenio, na nenga nalongo gwino kwa kulombana na Kilichitu, ngahotwi kunnaghalikiya changajhoghopa nhenge chimipala kuhenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Nambo nhwalo nimpala, mbaha ninnyope, ndenda naha ihoto kubhehe ne Pauli ng'oime, na ngohe napungwa ku nhwalo gwa kunhenge Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Yenie ninnyopa muntangatile Onechimo, jwakibha mwanango kwa kulombona na Kilichitu putukibha mu kipungo. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Makacho akibha kilebhenacho, nambo ngohe abhii na lihengo kwa nenga na kwino mwenga hele.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ngohe nimujhicha kabhele kwino, jwenio ngita mwojho gwango. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Nikapahi atame na nenga, antendele lihengo lende lyu kuntangatii mwe kone mmii mombo mu kipungo, ku nhwalo gwa kwatangachii bhando Lilobhe lya Mbone. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Nambo mbahijhe kunchokolekeya undangatile, nambo nipala nhenge chimipala, yenio nihenga jhe chochoha ade mabhene nnyeketele.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pange Onechimo natama na mwenga kwa machiko ghandina tugha, abhujha kabhele kwino ntame nako machiko ghoha. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ngohe jwenio mmanda kabhe jhe, nambo jwenio jwaumbone kuliku mmanda, jwenio ngohe nnongo gwito mu kulombana na Kilichitu. Ambahi nenga na impala mwenga hake, nhwalo jwenio ngita nnyito na nnongo mu kulombana na Bhambo.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Bhahe, anda umona ne kubhehe nalongo bhino ku kulombana na Bhambo, mumpokela Onechimo ngita hela ngaumbokii nenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Anda antendi chochoha changanandela, amu abhii na lighambo kwino, nanepa nenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ne Pauli nijhandika namwete kwa lubhoko lwango, naninepa! Mbaijhe nikomboche unnepe ughome gwino. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Bhahe, nnongo gwango, undendela yenio ku kundangatii nenga ku nhwalo gwa Bhambo, ngohe mwe malongo bhango mu kulombana na Kilichitu muhanganiche mwojho gwango.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Nhwalo chakaka ninhobholela, ninnyandikii ghanga, manye nanhenga kupeta ghanga ghuninnobholile. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Pamonga na gheniya, unenganikiye chumbi chukugholoka nhwalo ghu kujhopa kwino ninhobholela Chapanga najhangula, na nenga nanintyangila kwenio.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambuchilo jha kujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafula, mpungwa nnyango ku nhwalo gwa kunhenge Kilichitu Yecho, innyambucha. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Helahela akahenga mahengo bhajhango Maluku na Alichitako na Dema na Luka, na bhene bhinnyambucha.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Umbone gwa Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu utame pamonga umiojho jhino.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>